    /// Post-failure: called **instead of** `post_execute` when the inner tool
    /// call returned `Err`. Default is a no-op, so every existing hook keeps
    /// its behaviour byte-for-byte.
    ///
    /// Returns `Result<(), String>` rather than a `PostHookResult`: the tool
    /// call already failed, and its `Err` is the message the model must see. A
